  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">편안한 방학 보내고 계시죠?<br>&#160;<br>한&#160;학기&#160;동안&#160;<br>학생&#160;안에&#160;있는&#160;가능성을&#160;발견해주신, <br>&#39;마법의 지니&#39;가 되어주신 재과만 선생님들,&#160; <br>정말&#160;애쓰셨습니다!&#160;<br>진짜&#160;대단하셨어요!<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>1학기를 돌아보고,<br>2학기를 계획해보는 시간을<br>스스로 만들어보세요~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/781abca51eb8fe359073e5ec9745d5b8e21396c0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1ZSe3/781abca51eb8fe359073e5ec9745d5b8e21396c0\" data-origin-width=\"1046\" data-origin-height=\"601\"></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/11ac30588a8fc7faae471f081e9e8c2002ff1f0e?download\" data-file-name=\"선생님을 위한 학기말 마음 기록장(운암고 김영학).hwpx\" data-file-size=\"1560347\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DAM6%26dataid%3D365%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20260724092120&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F11ac30588a8fc7faae471f081e9e8c2002ff1f0e')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">선생님을 위한 학기말 마음 기록장(운암고 김영학)</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.49MB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
